\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces GDT system architecture. Query embeddings are projected to the SPD manifold $\mathcal  {S}_d^+$. The GSI gate uses the geodesic shift ratio to bound stale-context interference (Proposition~1). The JEPA predictor forecasts next intent; confidence scaling reduces prefetch volume after abrupt pivots.}}{15}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cma_components}{{5}{15}{GDT system architecture. Query embeddings are projected to the SPD manifold $\mathcal {S}_d^+$. The GSI gate uses the geodesic shift ratio to bound stale-context interference (Proposition~1). The JEPA predictor forecasts next intent; confidence scaling reduces prefetch volume after abrupt pivots}{figure.5}{}}
